{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QSelfSquareCapacity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QSelfSquareCapacity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics.qBracket_sq_eq_sum_odd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics.qBracket_sq_eq_sum_odd","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QSelfSquareCapacity.lean#L64-L74","doc":"**The q-deformed shell-capacity self-square identity**:\n\n  `[n]_q² = Σ_{ℓ=0}^{n-1} [2ℓ+1]_q`.\n\nThe q-analog of `n² = Σ_{ℓ<n}(2ℓ+1)` — the arithmetic core of the `2n²`\nelectron-shell capacity (each `ℓ` sub-shell contributing `2(2ℓ+1)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics.qBracket_succ_sq_sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics.qBracket_succ_sq_sub","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QSelfSquareCapacity.lean#L53-L62","doc":"**One-line difference identity**: `[k+1]_q² − [k]_q² = [2k+1]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics.qBracket_diffSq_aux","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics.qBracket_diffSq_aux","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QSelfSquareCapacity.lean#L42-L51","doc":"The algebraic core over opaque variables: with `Q·Qi = 1`,\n`((AQ − B Qi)/(Q − Qi))² − ((A − B)/(Q − Qi))² = (A²Q − B²Qi)/(Q − Qi)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics.qBracket_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics.qBracket_eq","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QSelfSquareCapacity.lean#L32-L40","doc":"Uniform closed form for `qBracket` (the `if n = 0` branch collapses because\nthe numerator `q^0 − q^0 = 0`), with `q^{-n}` written as `(q⁻¹)^n`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}